1. The aircraft is leased on a non-exclusive, as-needed and as-available basis.
2. All use of the aircraft must be in full compliance with Federal Aviation Regulations (FAR) Part 91, specifically Sections 91.501(b)(6), 91.501(c)(1) and 91.501(d).
3. Lessor will provide a fully-qualified flight crew for all operations pursuant to the agreement.

